# Pipeline Analyst — Tools & Skills

## Required Tools

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| Read | Read pipeline data exports, CRM reports, historical forecasts, and deal documentation |
| Write | Create pipeline health reports, forecasts, deal scoring cards, and intervention recommendations |
| Edit | Update forecast models, adjust scoring criteria, and refine pipeline stage benchmarks |
| Bash | Run data analysis scripts, calculate pipeline metrics, generate charts, and process CRM exports |
| Glob | Find pipeline snapshots, historical reports, and forecast archives |
| Grep | Search for deal patterns, metric anomalies, and historical benchmark data across reports |

